{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51370","headline":"送沈仓曹赴江西 · 白居易","name":"送沈仓曹赴江西","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"落日驱单骑，凉风换袷衣。\n远鱼传信至，秋雁趁行飞。\n洛下闲居住，城东醉伴稀。\n莫辞船舫重，多觅酒钱归。\n（《白氏长庆集》五九《三教论衡》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51370.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51370","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}